      "title": "Ensure access is controlled through SSO and not AWS IAM defined users",
      "resource": "aws_iam_user.privesc11-PutGroupPolicy-user",
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "explanation": "The file defines a standalone IAM user. Best practices recommend using AWS Identity Center (SSO) for human access to avoid long-lived credentials and simplify permission management."
